"簡繁注音完全離線運作，不收集、不上傳輸入內容，也沒有廣告或分析服務。\n\n鍵盤不要求完整取用。個人詞庫由主程式管理，鍵盤讀取；選字及聯想記憶留在鍵盤自己的本機空間。\n\n注音未完成時顯示在鍵盤組字列，按聲調或一聲完成音節；點候選更換選字，按確認或空白送出文字。聯想鍵提供接續詞。\n\niOS 在密碼、部分電話欄位或不允許第三方鍵盤的應用中，會使用系統鍵盤。\n\n來源：https://github.com/AllenPeng0209/jianfan-zhuyin" = "Jianfan Zhuyin works entirely offline. It does not collect or upload typing, and includes no ads or analytics.\n\nThe keyboard does not request Full Access. The main app manages your personal dictionary; the keyboard reads it and keeps learning in its own local storage.\n\nIncomplete input appears in the keyboard's composition bar. Use a tone key or First tone to complete a syllable, tap a candidate to change a word, and use Confirm or Space to insert text. Related shows phrase continuations.\n\niOS uses the system keyboard in password fields, some telephone fields, and apps that disable third-party keyboards.\n\nSource: https://github.com/AllenPeng0209/jianfan-zhuyin";
